<% Current.meta_tags.set(title: t(".title")) %>

<%= render layout: "public/legal_page", locals: {title: t(".title"), updated: nil} do %>
  <section>
    <h2>What Cove is</h2>
    <p>
      Cove is a calm place for homeschool families to plan, track, and run their school year.
      One family account holds your students, your plans, and your records, and one or two parents can manage it together.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What it helps with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Plan the year.</strong> Lay out subjects and schedules for every student in one place.</li>
      <li><strong>Keep the records.</strong> Attendance, grades, and progress captured as you go, ready when you need them.</li>
      <li><strong>Run the day.</strong> See what's next for each student without rebuilding the plan every morning.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <p>
      Homeschooling works best when the parent is in charge. We build tools that save you time and stay out of your way,
      and we keep your family's information private and yours.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who it's for</h2>
    <p>
      Cove is for individual homeschool families. If you're teaching your own children at home, it's built for you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p>Questions? Email <%= mail_to Jumpstart.config.support_email %>.</p>
<% end %>
